        Towards Low-Resource Alignment to Diverse Perspectives with Sparse Feedback
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Luo%2C+C+F">Chu Fei Luo</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Dahan%2C+S">Samuel Dahan</a>, 
      
