    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        <span class="search-hit mathjax">Learning</span> a Generalized Model for Substation Level Voltage Estimation in <span class="search-hit mathjax">Distribution</span> Networks
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Za%27ter%2C+M+E">Muhy Eddin Za&#39;ter</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Hodge%2C+B">Bri-Mathias Hodge</a>
      
