    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        GOGH: Correlation-Guided Orchestration of GPUs in Heterogeneous Clusters
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Raeisi%2C+A">Ahmad Raeisi</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Dolati%2C+M">Mahdi Dolati</a>, 
      
